{"id":"210dad0d9d959bef","group":"20","path":"20/20-lem-splitting-totality.md","title":"分裂自动机的全性判据","display":"lem-splitting-totality — 分裂自动机的全性判据","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-lem-splitting-totality","aliases":["20-lem-splitting-totality"],"display":"lem-splitting-totality — 分裂自动机的全性判据","chapter":"12","section":"12.3","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Remark 12.3.2 的归纳验证","source_printed_pages":[200],"source_pdf_pages":[230],"depends_on":["[[20-df-splitting-procedure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-lem-splitting-totality"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-lem-splitting-totality</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-splitting-totality — 分裂自动机的全性判据"},{"key":"chapter","html":"12"},{"key":"section","html":"12.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Remark 12.3.2 的归纳验证"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>200</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>230</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"94da30522fe93e7f\" href=\"?note=94da30522fe93e7f\" title=\"20-df-splitting-procedure\">20-df-splitting-procedure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 全可计算函数树；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{ran}(T)\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{ran}(T)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=\\operatorname{Sp}(T,\\sigma,e)\">\\(S=\\operatorname{Sp}(T,\\sigma,e)\\)</span>；每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\\in\\operatorname{ran}(T)\">\\(\\nu\\in\\operatorname{ran}(T)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\preceq\\nu\">\\(\\sigma\\preceq\\nu\\)</span> 都不是 e-黑节点。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"94da30522fe93e7f\" href=\"?note=94da30522fe93e7f\" title=\"20-df-splitting-procedure\">20-df-splitting-procedure</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}splitting-totality}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{dom}(S)=2^{&lt;\\omega}\\quad\\land\\quad\\operatorname{EWhite}(S,e)\\quad\\land\\quad S\\subseteq_f T.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}splitting-totality}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{dom}(S)=2^{&lt;\\omega}\\quad\\land\\quad\\operatorname{EWhite}(S,e)\\quad\\land\\quad S\\subseteq_f T.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>根已定义；若父值已定义，假设给出某个分裂，有限见证搜索必停，两个子值都定义。按域串长度归纳得到全性；每对兄弟的输出就是所搜索分裂，故白性成立；全部值来自 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>，故为子函数树。</p>\n<p>来源：Remark 12.3.2 的归纳验证；印刷页 200；PDF 第 230 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-splitting-procedure","status":"resolved","id":"94da30522fe93e7f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-splitting-procedure]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-splitting-procedure","status":"resolved","id":"94da30522fe93e7f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-splitting-procedure]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{ran}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"S=\\operatorname{Sp}(T,\\sigma,e)","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu\\in\\operatorname{ran}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma\\preceq\\nu","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}splitting-totality}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{dom}(S)=2^{<\\omega}\\quad\\land\\quad\\operatorname{EWhite}(S,e)\\quad\\land\\quad S\\subseteq_f T.","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false}],"bytes":1350,"backlinks":[{"id":"cb6a5dd98b8b185b","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-splitting-procedure]]；see [[20-lem-black-restriction]]；see [[20-lem-splitting-totality]]；see [[20-lem-color-inheritance]]。"}],"outgoing":["94da30522fe93e7f"]}